WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,640
Are you picking up trash here?

2
00:00:01,640 --> 00:00:03,000
I see you have a strong body

3
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,120
And he seemed to have some skills when he hit people just now

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:06,720
How much money can you make picking up trash?

5
00:00:06,720 --> 00:00:08,360
Otherwise, come to my place and help me look after the factory.

6
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:09,800
I'll pay you

7
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:11,720
How much salary can you give me

8
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:12,760
What salary do you want

9
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:14,560
It depends on how many hours you work here.

10
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:16,240
We usually only work at night

11
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:18,000
Why is it closed during the day?

12
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:19,120
you have other jobs during the day

13
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:21,280
During the day, I have to help people carry a building and I have no time.

14
00:00:21,280 --> 00:00:24,800
Can you handle carrying a building during the day and working here at night? You should be able to

15
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:25,760
i had a time

16
00:00:25,760 --> 00:00:27,200
I haven't graduated in almost half a month

17
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:30,520
Is it difficult at home? Can it be difficult without difficulty?

18
00:00:30,520 --> 00:00:31,760
Three hundred people in my city

19
00:00:31,760 --> 00:00:34,740
Are you still waiting for me to solve the vitality problem? That's it.

20
00:00:34,740 --> 00:00:36,740
I invite you to come to our place and help me inspect the factory.

21
00:00:36,740 --> 00:00:38,420
I'll pay you five hundred yuan a night

22
00:00:38,420 --> 00:00:40,620
You don't have to be here to watch if anything happens to me

23
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:41,820
Please help me look straight again

24
00:00:41,820 --> 00:00:43,300
Your outfit is very suitable for visiting a factory

25
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:44,620
What are the working hours?

26
00:00:44,620 --> 00:00:45,660
your working hours

27
00:00:45,660 --> 00:00:47,300
11pm to 4am

28
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:49,660
In other words, five hours at night is enough

29
00:00:49,660 --> 00:00:50,580
But I do daily work

30
00:00:50,580 --> 00:00:51,780
I'll take it one day at a time

31
00:00:51,780 --> 00:00:53,180
If I don't come, I won't get paid.

32
00:00:53,180 --> 00:00:54,540
Because I still have some things to do here

33
00:00:54,540 --> 00:00:56,340
I can't guarantee that I can come every night.

34
00:00:56,340 --> 00:01:00,750
Then come in with me

35
00:01:00,750 --> 00:01:05,030
Let the white people over there ask for it. We have surveillance here. Even if someone takes something, we will know. Don't worry, no one wants it.
